    "Reason : 1 - The boundary treatment by reason of its scale and design appears visually discordant, significantly bulky and dominant within its context resulting is harm to the character and appearance of the Hollies Way development and the Temperley Road streetscene. The development therefore fails to comply with policies LP1 and LP5 of the Wandsworth Local Plan (2023), and the guidance of the Wandsworth Housing SPD (2016).\r\n",
